WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:09.719
Emily: I wanted to get a head start on figuring
out my career and really having an idea of

00:00:09.719 --> 00:00:15.179
if this is the world for me, if I really want
to be in DC. Having this opportunity to both

00:00:15.179 --> 00:00:20.599
work but still get my politics courses in
was perfect.

00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:25.619
My favorite part of the internship would probably
be feeling like I'm finally in the middle

00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:30.939
of something that really not just matters,
because what happens at Hillsdale obviously

00:00:30.939 --> 00:00:37.170
matters too--getting an education--but being
out in the world and being able to influence,

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:42.120
even if it's tiny little ways, legislation
and what's going on specifically on Capitol

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:47.539
Hill.
It can prepare you to really be able to see

00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:51.780
other people's viewpoints. When you're in
a city that can have so many controversies

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:56.859
over everything, being able to understand
where they're coming from but still hold fast

00:00:56.859 --> 00:01:01.030
to your beliefs is something that Hillsdale
really prepares you for. WHIP itself is a

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:03.870
great way to test that out.

